      "title": "Guide — Ziggart 3D Avatar, HairDeck Physics, VRM Auto-Rigger & Live Webcam 'Replace Me' Mocap Studio",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 13 : ZIGGART 3D AVATAR & LIVE WEBCAM MOCAP SUITE\n1. AUTO-CACHE : ZiggartAvatarModelDownloader downloads HairDeck & Make-It-Animatable once into ComfyUI/models/3d/ziggart_avatars and reuses them permanently.\n2. CANONICAL PREP & HAIRDECK : ZiggartAvatarCanonicalPrep separates body vs hair so Hunyuan3D/SPAR3D builds a clean body mesh while ZiggartHairDeckGenerator creates 3D Hair Cards + Spring-Bone chains.\n3. RIGGING, BLENDSHAPES & VRM : ZiggartAutoRigger fits a 25-bone VRM humanoid armature, ZiggartFacialBlendshapeBuilder adds 20 lip-sync/blink/fun morphs, and ZiggartVRMAssembler exports a native .vrm avatar.\n4. LIVE WEBCAM 'REPLACE ME' : Click '🎥 Toggle Live Webcam & Mic Mocap' or '🗗 Pop-Out Broadcast Window' on ZiggartVRMPoseAndMocapStudio to animate the avatar live at 60 FPS!"
      ],
      "color": "#234",
      "bgcolor": "#356"
    },
